# Runtime state that ends up here (not in ~/.config/Ascend/) when initBaseDir()'s fallback
# path is taken (app/src/glfwmain.cpp / app/linux/linuxmain.cpp) -- observed happening
# repeatedly during headless agent testing in this repo, root cause not yet fixed. These
# must never be committed and should never silently shadow a real ~/.config/Ascend/ setup.
